        "content": "[Service]\nEnvironment=KIROCREW_POLICY_URL=file:///etc/kirocrew-demo/security-policy.json\nEnvironment=KIROCREW_POLICY_ON_UNAVAILABLE=fail_closed\nDevicePolicy=strict\nDeviceAllow=\nDeviceAllow=/dev/null rw\nDeviceAllow=/dev/zero rw\nDeviceAllow=/dev/full rw\nDeviceAllow=/dev/random rw\nDeviceAllow=/dev/urandom rw\n",
